// Who the iOS app is built as: the publisher's team, bundle ID and App
// Group. A build of your own, under your own Apple developer account,
// changes these three and nothing else (app/README.md, "Building it
// yourself"). Runner and the notification extension take them from here,
// and their entitlements and Info.plists from those.
PIRC_TEAM = 4PC6T9727Y
PIRC_BUNDLE_ID = dev.pirc.app
PIRC_APP_GROUP = group.dev.pirc.app
